# Generated screenshots and traces. shots-ref/ IS tracked on purpose -- it is
# the visual baseline run_tests.sh is compared against, and
# shots-ref-77avemu/ is the independent 77AVEMU render of the same rows at the
# same instant, which is the only thing that can catch a fault the core's own
# reference moves with (trap 25).
shots/
*.png
!shots-ref/
!shots-ref/*.png
!shots-ref-77avemu/
!shots-ref-77avemu/*.png
.DS_Store
